Ayuda, ayuda.

1708
01:57:38,502 --> 01:57:39,502
¿Cooper?

1709
01:57:46,295 --> 01:57:47,574
Case.

1710
01:57:48,083 --> 01:57:49,114
Estoy sin aire.

1711
01:57:50,068 --> 01:57:51,068
Amoníaco.

1712
01:57:52,976 --> 01:57:54,443
Cooper. Ya vamos.

1713
01:57:54,524 --> 01:57:56,424
- Vamos Case.
- Tengo su posición.

1714
01:57:56,506 --> 01:57:57,721
Vamos, vamos, vamos.

1715
01:57:57,799 --> 01:57:58,840
Allá vamos.

1716
01:58:10,591 --> 01:58:13,428
