1723
01:58:40,739 --> 01:58:43,299
Ya llegamos, ya llegamos.

1724
01:58:43,411 --> 01:58:45,152
Ya estamos ahí. Case vamos.

1725
01:58:45,190 --> 01:58:48,306
Rápido, rápido, rápido

1726
01:58:48,413 --> 01:58:49,413
Cooper.

1727
01:58:53,038 --> 01:58:55,413
Aguanta, vamos.

1728
01:59:01,637 --> 01:59:05,006
Lo veo, lo veo.

1729
01:59:05,086 --> 01:59:06,086
Hacia la derecha.

1730
01:59:24,058 --> 01:59:25,058
Cooper.

1731
01:59:25,082 --> 01:59:27,357
Cooper.

1732
01:59:32,903 --> 01:59:33,922
Ten.

1733
01:59:41,764 --> 01:59:43,453
Vamos, vamos

1734
01:59:50,035 --> 01:59:52,372
Estos datos, no tienen sentido.

1735
01:59:59,992 --> 02:00:01,833
Lo siento.

1736
02:00:01,945 --> 02:00:03,525
