1738
02:00:12,072 --> 02:00:15,140
- Cooper.
- Corre.

1739
02:00:15,264 --> 02:00:18,177
Romilly.

1740
02:00:18,286 --> 02:00:20,700
Romilly, ¿me escuchas?

1741
02:00:20,780 --> 02:00:21,574
Romilly.

1742
02:00:21,683 --> 02:00:23,457
Apártese profesor, apártese.

1743
02:00:30,822 --> 02:00:34,099
- Romilly.
- Romilly, ¿Me escuchas?

1744
02:00:36,453 --> 02:00:38,071
Ten cuidado.

1745
02:00:39,223 --> 02:00:40,482
